00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:52.890
blows my fuckin' face off.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.300
Whether it's me or somebody else,

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.340
I have my mom and I'm
trying to do it for you.

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:57.173
It's really simple.

00:09:57.173 --> 00:09:58.290
It's fuckin' binary.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.280
You either think you can
fuckin' do this or you don't.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.270
And the fact that I for some reason

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:06.150
am helping a bunch of you get
there, it makes me real happy.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:08.290
But if I'm not, go find that thing

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.370
that absolutely fuckin' gets you there

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.040
because if you do not believe in yourself,

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.740
you have zero fuckin' chance

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.023
and if you do believe in yourself,

00:10:15.023 --> 00:10:16.760
you have every fuckin' chance

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.320
to live it the way you want to live it.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.930
So listen, if I'm not doin' it for you,

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.090
get the fuck out of here.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:24.160
Go find a book, a parent,

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.240
a fuckin' long lost high school friend,

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.320
I don't give a fuck.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.610
Find the thing that
makes you fuckin' believe

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.610
'cause that's the thing
that's fuckin' working.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.210
I just understood that I had something

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.980
and I felt that I could fight through.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:38.110
I was enjoying the process.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:40.660
I wasn't doing it to become rich,

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.840
so that wasn't making me impatient.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.290
And so just kind of old
school, brick by brick,

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.940
brick by brick and 12
years later you look up

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.240
and you've got a building.

